  "text": "Let's talk autonomous trucking\n\nGet in touch\nCompany\nWe built our own road.\n\nIn 2021, AI visionary Raquel Urtasun founded Waabi with an unwavering belief that Physical AI could revolutionize how humanity moves and connects. \n\n\nWhat began as a bold dream has become something far greater. Waabi is a global force pioneering a breakthrough approach that demonstrates autonomous vehicles can be scalable, efficient, and safe.\n\n\"When this technology is at scale, it will save so many lives. Improving safety on the road is one of the most important motivators for me.\"\n\nRaquel Urtasun\nFounder & CEO of Waabi\n\nThe people moving us forward.\n\nBehind every breakthrough at Waabi are people who care deeply about reshaping the physical world through diverse perspectives, from AI researchers and roboticists to trucking experts and operators.\u00a0\n\nLearn more\nInvestors\n\nOur approach to Physical AI has earned the backing of world-class investors who share our vision for efficient, safe, and scalable autonomous solutions.\n\nThe latest from Waabi.\n\nWe\u2019re leading conversations across AI, autonomy, freight, and transportation. Explore our latest news, insights, and milestones.\n\nCompany news\nTrucks\nOctober 14, 2026\nWaabi and Warrior Logistics partner on autonomous trucking operations in Texas\nCompany news\nOctober 5, 2026\nVolvo and Waabi Kick Off Customer Operations in Texas, Starting with Warp\nCompany news\nSeptember 22, 2026\nBuilt to generalize. Proven on I-35.\nCompany news\nSeptember 15, 2026\n80% Growth on Long Haul's Toughest Corridor\nJune 26, 2026\nWaabi crosses the next frontier of generalization, unlocking truly scalable AVs\nResearch\nApril 22, 2026\nAll You Need to Know About Self-Driving | CVPR Tutorial 2026\nCompany news\nJanuary 28, 2026\nWaabi secures $1 Billion in new funding to lead Physical AI revolution\nTechnology\nCompany news\nDecember 19, 2025\nFrom closed course to public roads: The path to driverless\nTechnology\nCompany news\nNovember 25, 2025\nWaabi unlocks direct-to-customer model with surface street driving capabilities\nUpcoming events\nOctober 17, 2026\n\nATA Management Conference & Exhibition\n\nCharlotte, NC\nOctober 26, 2026\n\nFreightWaves F3: Future of Freight Festival\n\nChattanooga, TN\nOctober 28, 2026\n\nNASTC Annual Conference\n\nNashville, TN\nOur locations.\nWith teams across Toronto, San Francisco, Dallas, Phoenix, and Pittsburgh, Waabi is expanding within major tech and logistics centers.\nWe're just getting started\n\nFollow along or reach out directly at\npress@waabi.ai|info@waabi.ai\n\nAbout us\nHome\nSafety\nResearch\nCompany\nCareers\nInsights\n\u00a9 2026 Waabi. All Rights Reserved.\nPrivacy Policy\nWe value your privacy\nThis site uses cookies to improve your browsing experience, analyze site traffic, and show personalized content.\nReject All\nAccept All\nCustomize",
